    "title": "Grenades found in Marina destroyed by MCSO Bomb Squad - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MARINA, Calif. (KION-TV) - Two grenades found in Marina were destroyed by the Bomb Squad this morning. The two grenades were found near the 400 block of Ridgeview Avenue around 7 a.m., according to Marina Police. Monterey County Sheriff's Office Bomb Squad responded to the area and evacuated residents as they destroyed the devices. The post Grenades found in Marina destroyed by MCSO Bomb Squad appeared first on KION546 .",
